  "duration_s": 270.6039,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "李恩，你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，领导的暗示，你能听得懂吗？没有啊，哎被偷你干什么？赵总，茅台都被偷了，你为什么不让我说呀？赵总能不知道车里有没有酒吗？不是，这职场上理会错，领导的意思是大忌。车里没有酒，赵总却让你送上去，说明他只在意结果，你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？满足领导的需求最重要哦，赵总，您车里的东西我不好乱翻，就自己准备了。四瓶两瓶留在您车里，这两瓶拿上来您先用。好好好，我赵总，咱们下次见。好，刘总，你怎么走了呀，是不是嫌报价不满意啊？恭喜赵总，拿下合同李恩，后续项目你来负责吧。嗯，不哎哎，赵总这哎老婆这怎么回事儿？这个项目一直是刘涛在负责，赵总突然把项目给我了。茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，象征着交易达成。刘涛连这个都不懂，赵总怎么敢把项目给他呀？不能吧，人情世故，可是门大学问，你要学的呀，还多着呢。老婆，赵总把上次的酒钱转过来了，你看哎，你怎么收了呀？赵总转多，你赶紧给退回去。你自以为有原则的退还，只会让领导觉得更麻烦，还不如大大方方收下呢。那我是不是得说点啥呀？嗯，你就说感谢领导，大气，果然跟着领导有甜头吃这样就行了。当然不行啊。来，赵总，请大家喝奶茶了啊，人人都有，我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？奶茶钱，您不跟酒钱一块转给我了吗？李恩周天来家里坐坐，尝尝，你嫂子手艺，嗨，嫂子，你可算出来了，我都快憋死了。嗯嗯，你拉我干什么？我也很急啊，憋死我了。嗯，不知道的，还以为洗手间是什么好地方。哎呀，行了，你们坐我去做饭，老赵帮我处理一下鱼，老婆，我怎么看？赵总和嫂子有点不高兴啊，哎因为异性厕所十分钟效应，人家赵总老婆刚从卫生间出来，你就算再着急，也等十分钟，再怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。嫂子，我来帮你。赵总嫂子，那我走了，嗯嗯，那我们也先走，李恩留下接待王总的事情，咱们再碰一下，那得叫张强回来啊，不用你负责就行。哎哎，老婆，你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，这都是不成文的社交规则。你呀多看看这本闲谈高手吧。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听见这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了。他写的是别人夸你优秀，你就回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里，有句话我特别欣赏。他说，有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻，对吧？哇，这句话太好了，他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就会比以前好多了。现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。我读到这段的时候，这真是让我欲解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就是手把手教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我近几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这个书适合所有人，让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "李恩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 890,
      "end_ms": 2730,
      "text": "你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3050,
      "end_ms": 3870,
      "text": "领导的暗示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4010,
      "end_ms": 5010,
      "text": "你能听得懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5170,
      "end_ms": 5730,
      "text": "没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 8670,
      "text": "哎被偷你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8770,
      "end_ms": 9110,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 9110,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "茅台都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 9970,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "你为什么不让我说呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 11750,
      "end_ms": 13450,
      "text": "赵总能不知道车里有没有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 13850,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 13850,
      "end_ms": 15790,
      "text": "这职场上理会错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 15790,
      "end_ms": 17030,
      "text": "领导的意思是大忌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 17310,
      "end_ms": 18170,
      "text": "车里没有酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 18410,
      "end_ms": 19730,
      "text": "赵总却让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 19910,
      "end_ms": 21210,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 21410,
      "end_ms": 24150,
      "text": "你又何必去纠结车里酒的去向和真实性呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 24230,
      "end_ms": 26210,
      "text": "满足领导的需求最重要哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 29290,
      "end_ms": 29670,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 30170,
      "end_ms": 31690,
      "text": "您车里的东西我不好乱翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 31830,
      "end_ms": 32510,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 32510,
      "end_ms": 34070,
      "text": "四瓶两瓶留在您车里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 34070,
      "end_ms": 35310,
      "text": "这两瓶拿上来您先用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36150,
      "end_ms": 36955,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 40520,
      "end_ms": 45320,
      "text": "我赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 45660,
      "end_ms": 46580,
      "text": "咱们下次见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 46700,
      "end_ms": 47115,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50800,
      "end_ms": 51220,
      "text": "刘总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51440,
      "end_ms": 52360,
      "text": "你怎么走了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52360,
      "end_ms": 53760,
      "text": "是不是嫌报价不满意啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56960,
      "end_ms": 57700,
      "text": "恭喜赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57720,
      "end_ms": 60125,
      "text": "拿下合同李恩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60620,
      "end_ms": 62165,
      "text": "后续项目你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 63810,
      "end_ms": 63990,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63990,
      "end_ms": 65240,
      "text": "不哎哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65240,
      "end_ms": 68455,
      "text": "赵总这哎老婆这怎么回事儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68710,
      "end_ms": 70330,
      "text": "这个项目一直是刘涛在负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 70530,
      "end_ms": 72055,
      "text": "赵总突然把项目给我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 72510,
      "end_ms": 74430,
      "text": "茶汤回湖是谈判的收尾动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 74530,
      "end_ms": 75630,
      "text": "象征着交易达成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 75830,
      "end_ms": 76870,
      "text": "刘涛连这个都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 76870,
      "end_ms": 78315,
      "text": "赵总怎么敢把项目给他呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 78620,
      "end_ms": 79205,
      "text": "不能吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 79580,
      "end_ms": 80340,
      "text": "人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 80340,
      "end_ms": 81355,
      "text": "可是门大学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 81680,
      "end_ms": 82495,
      "text": "你要学的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82670,
      "end_ms": 83205,
      "text": "还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 85890,
      "end_ms": 86315,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 86600,
      "end_ms": 87820,
      "text": "赵总把上次的酒钱转过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87820,
      "end_ms": 89510,
      "text": "你看哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 89510,
      "end_ms": 90330,
      "text": "你怎么收了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90330,
      "end_ms": 90790,
      "text": "赵总转多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 90790,
      "end_ms": 91665,
      "text": "你赶紧给退回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 91870,
      "end_ms": 93310,
      "text": "你自以为有原则的退还，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 93550,
      "end_ms": 94975,
      "text": "只会让领导觉得更麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95430,
      "end_ms": 96870,
      "text": "还不如大大方方收下呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 96870,
      "end_ms": 98230,
      "text": "那我是不是得说点啥呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 98250,
      "end_ms": 98410,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 98410,
      "end_ms": 99730,
      "text": "你就说感谢领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 99730,
      "end_ms": 100090,
      "text": "大气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 100090,
      "end_ms": 102870,
      "text": "果然跟着领导有甜头吃这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 102990,
      "end_ms": 103965,
      "text": "当然不行啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 106210,
      "end_ms": 106430,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 106430,
      "end_ms": 106770,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 106770,
      "end_ms": 108010,
      "text": "请大家喝奶茶了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 108010,
      "end_ms": 108955,
      "text": "人人都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 110420,
      "end_ms": 112180,
      "text": "我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 112320,
      "end_ms": 112820,
      "text": "奶茶钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 112820,
      "end_ms": 114605,
      "text": "您不跟酒钱一块转给我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 117400,
      "end_ms": 119640,
      "text": "李恩周天来家里坐坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 119800,
      "end_ms": 120160,
      "text": "尝尝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 120160,
      "end_ms": 121035,
      "text": "你嫂子手艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 121780,
      "end_ms": 122085,
      "text": "嗨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 125710,
      "end_ms": 126150,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 126250,
      "end_ms": 127310,
      "text": "你可算出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 127310,
      "end_ms": 128275,
      "text": "我都快憋死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 128760,
      "end_ms": 132540,
      "text": "嗯嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 133580,
      "end_ms": 134520,
      "text": "你拉我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 134520,
      "end_ms": 135560,
      "text": "我也很急啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 135740,
      "end_ms": 136735,
      "text": "憋死我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 137510,
      "end_ms": 137800,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 138220,
      "end_ms": 138780,
      "text": "不知道的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 138780,
      "end_ms": 140700,
      "text": "还以为洗手间是什么好地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 140900,
      "end_ms": 141300,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 141340,
      "end_ms": 142045,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 142770,
      "end_ms": 143790,
      "text": "你们坐我去做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 143950,
      "end_ms": 145425,
      "text": "老赵帮我处理一下鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 147260,
      "end_ms": 147715,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 148290,
      "end_ms": 148750,
      "text": "我怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 148750,
      "end_ms": 150485,
      "text": "赵总和嫂子有点不高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 150750,
      "end_ms": 153125,
      "text": "哎因为异性厕所十分钟效应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 153490,
      "end_ms": 155370,
      "text": "人家赵总老婆刚从卫生间出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 155370,
      "end_ms": 156310,
      "text": "你就算再着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 156310,
      "end_ms": 156970,
      "text": "也等十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 156970,
      "end_ms": 159935,
      "text": "再怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 160490,
      "end_ms": 160910,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 161050,
      "end_ms": 161705,
      "text": "我来帮你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 162120,
      "end_ms": 163105,
      "text": "赵总嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 163500,
      "end_ms": 164215,
      "text": "那我走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 165140,
      "end_ms": 166140,
      "text": "嗯嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 167160,
      "end_ms": 168255,
      "text": "那我们也先走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 168940,
      "end_ms": 171885,
      "text": "李恩留下接待王总的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 172330,
      "end_ms": 173235,
      "text": "咱们再碰一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 173930,
      "end_ms": 174990,
      "text": "那得叫张强回来啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 174990,
      "end_ms": 176815,
      "text": "不用你负责就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 179480,
      "end_ms": 180790,
      "text": "哎哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 180790,
      "end_ms": 181265,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 181700,
      "end_ms": 184755,
      "text": "你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 185110,
      "end_ms": 186875,
      "text": "这都是不成文的社交规则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 187300,
      "end_ms": 190110,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本闲谈高手吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 190150,
      "end_ms": 191310,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 191370,
      "end_ms": 192130,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 192230,
      "end_ms": 193070,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 193290,
      "end_ms": 194505,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 194820,
      "end_ms": 196060,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 196220,
      "end_ms": 197635,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 197980,
      "end_ms": 201520,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听见这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 201520,
      "end_ms": 202725,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 202900,
      "end_ms": 204540,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 204660,
      "end_ms": 205200,
      "text": "你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 205320,
      "end_ms": 206600,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 206600,
      "end_ms": 207915,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 208210,
      "end_ms": 209135,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 209570,
      "end_ms": 210570,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 210730,
      "end_ms": 211595,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 211840,
      "end_ms": 212645,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 212940,
      "end_ms": 214045,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 214350,
      "end_ms": 215530,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 215650,
      "end_ms": 216950,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 217010,
      "end_ms": 219770,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 219850,
      "end_ms": 220090,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 220090,
      "end_ms": 221225,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 221620,
      "end_ms": 222300,
      "text": "在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 222300,
      "end_ms": 223455,
      "text": "有句话我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 223630,
      "end_ms": 223970,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 224090,
      "end_ms": 225510,
      "text": "有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 226590,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 226630,
      "end_ms": 227830,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 227970,
      "end_ms": 229455,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 229730,
      "end_ms": 229910,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 229910,
      "end_ms": 231090,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 231150,
      "end_ms": 232490,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 232570,
      "end_ms": 233110,
      "text": "随便翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 233110,
      "end_ms": 233490,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 233490,
      "end_ms": 233670,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 233670,
      "end_ms": 234805,
      "text": "这句话太好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 235000,
      "end_ms": 237180,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 237260,
      "end_ms": 238900,
      "text": "你就会比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00149",
      "start_ms": 238940,
      "end_ms": 240855,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00150",
      "start_ms": 241050,
      "end_ms": 242170,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00151",
      "start_ms": 242230,
      "end_ms": 244090,
      "text": "这真是让我欲解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00152",
      "start_ms": 244250,
      "end_ms": 246370,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00153",
      "start_ms": 246370,
      "end_ms": 249590,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00154",
      "start_ms": 249730,
      "end_ms": 252230,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00155",
      "start_ms": 252410,
      "end_ms": 256310,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00156",
      "start_ms": 256510,
      "end_ms": 259310,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00157",
      "start_ms": 259310,
      "end_ms": 260550,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00158",
      "start_ms": 260570,
      "end_ms": 261950,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00159",
      "start_ms": 261950,
      "end_ms": 264430,
      "text": "这是我近几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00160",
      "start_ms": 264570,
      "end_ms": 266290,
      "text": "我觉得这个书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00161",
      "start_ms": 266350,
      "end_ms": 269110,
      "text": "让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f531fac7d333139d_s00162",
      "start_ms": 269190,
      "end_ms": 270425,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
